.                 lincom  at_least_1d , level(90)
  8.                 scalar b1_`var'=r(estimate)
  9.                 scalar ub1_`var'=r(ub)
 10.                 scalar lb1_`var'=r(lb)
 11.                 scalar P1_`var'=r(p)
 12.                 scalar se1_`var'=r(se)
 13.                 
